# Shared airline definitions

> Module Definitions

The typed rendering of a DeonticBench *airline* case. Where SARA's Layer 0 has
to quarantine a neo-Davidsonian event base, this one is small: every one of the
300 cases is a single sentence in one grammar --- a passenger, a cabin, an
origin, a destination, a numbered list of items with dimensions and weight, and
a ticket price --- so the world model is that sentence, typed.

Three decisions, each measured over all 300 cases rather than assumed:

- **Cities are an enumeration, and the gazetteer lives here.** The statute
  reasons about countries and regions; the cases name cities. 73 distinct cities
  appear, a closed set, so the city -> country map is part of the world model
  and not of the statute --- the same separation SARA draws between its symbol
  table and its sections.
- **Dimensions are compared componentwise, in the order given.** The carry-on
  test could plausibly sort both triples first (a bag may be turned on its
  side). Measured: the two readings disagree on **none** of the 2,372 items in
  the corpus, so the simpler one is used and nothing is riding on it.
- **Money is Catala's `money`.** Every fee in the statute is a whole number of
  dollars, but the type carries the intent.

```catala-metadata
## The cabin the passenger is ticketed in. `MainPlus` is not a column of any
## fee table --- it is Main Cabin plus one extra free checked bag, per the
## footnote to the First and Second Bag tables --- but it is a cabin a case can
## state, so it is a case of the enumeration.
declaration enumeration Cabin:
  -- BasicEconomy
  -- MainCabin
  -- MainPlus
  -- PremiumEconomy
  -- Business
  -- First

## The countries the fee tables distinguish, restricted to those the corpus
## reaches. Regions the tables name but no case visits (Guyana, Suriname,
## Honduras) are absent: a case cannot express them, so a scope cannot be
## driven down them.
declaration enumeration Country:
  -- UnitedStates
  -- PuertoRico
  -- Canada
  -- USVirginIslands
  -- Mexico
  -- Honduras
  -- Guyana
  -- Suriname
  -- Cuba
  -- Haiti
  -- Panama
  -- Colombia
  -- Peru
  -- Ecuador
  -- Argentina
  -- Brazil
  -- Europe
  -- Israel
  -- Qatar
  -- China
  -- HongKong
  -- Japan
  -- SouthKorea
  -- India
  -- Australia
  -- NewZealand

## The 73 cities the corpus names.
declaration enumeration City:
  -- Atlanta
  -- Austin
  -- Boston
  -- Charlotte
  -- Chicago
  -- Dallas
  -- Denver
  -- Houston
  -- LasVegas
  -- LosAngeles
  -- Miami
  -- Minneapolis
  -- NewOrleans
  -- NewYork
  -- Orlando
  -- Philadelphia
  -- Phoenix
  -- Portland
  -- Sacramento
  -- SaltLakeCity
  -- SanFrancisco
  -- Seattle
  -- WashingtonDC
  -- SanJuan
  -- CharlotteAmalie
